Scope limit, stated so this green is not over-read: this checks that each figure
EXISTS in a source, NOT that the sentence around it is still the project's
position, and NOT that the figure was transcribed into the right sentence. A
withdrawn verdict whose arithmetic still reproduces passes this check -- that is
exactly the defect that sat under a green check here for 11 days. Only a human
read of the prose catches it.
